    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so pointless sometimes. like, we’re all just accidental chemical reactions on a tiny rock that doesn't even matter to the rest of the universe. everything we do, every struggle, it just disappears into nothingness anyway. how can anyone actually find a reason to keep going when the math just says we don't matter?",
